      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Small Update:\n\nThe Worlds Tab now functions as I wrote in my suggestion, the others still don't though.\n\nAll of the Tabs do this when switching between them though, but not when opening / closing the menu.\n\nCould this please be changed / fixed? This bothers me sooo much when using the menu...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-09T00:11:01.611Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nCurrently when clicking on things like Social or Avatars it will bring you to the last page you opened in that Tab. So for example when you have your Avatar Stats open, close the Menu and then reopen it again, it will still show you your Avatar Stats instead of the normal Avatars Page. Or it will reopen the Profile you last had opened in the Social Tab, or the last World you had open in the Worlds Tab.\nThis can be annoying when for example you quickly want to open your Avatar Menu again but instead of seeing it, you see some random Avatar Details you opened like 2h ago.\n# Suggestion:\nInstead of just opening the Tab as the user left it, it should just open the last Category you were in (the Categories on the left side). That way the user can still access the last Favourite list they had open for example without other random things being in the way.\nI could also see this being an Option people could change, like setting it to always reopen one specific category / list or to just reopen it as they last left it.",
